{
  "above": {
    "name": "native/kernel",
    "path": ".."
  },
  "layer": "native/kernel/tools",
  "name": "native/kernel/tools",
  "purpose": "Hosted (Linux-built) checkers for the native kernel, run by `make -C native/kernel test`; nothing here runs on the chip or sends anything to a device. ck_gsp_fw_inspect: GSP-RM firmware container parser + pin check. ck_gsp_cot_encode: byte-exact SEC2 chain-of-trust message encoder/decoder (docs/GB10_FIRMWARE_INVENTORY.md section 10). ck_gsp_bindata_extract: extracts and verifies the eight GB10B firmware arrays compiled into the pinned driver source, own DEFLATE/CRC-32/SHA-384 (section 11). Each tool has a selftest that refuses malformed input by name; NOT_RUN is never PASS.",
  "schema_version": "1.0.0"
}
